# **🧠 How the View Manifold interacts with the system**

| Subsystem | How it uses the View Manifold |
|----------|--------------------------------|
| **Interactive Visualizer** | Determines which axes to show |
| **Projection Modes** | Stores PCA/UMAP results |
| **3D Attractor View** | Uses PCA‑3D from the manifold |
| **Dashboard** | Uses labels + visible dims |
| **Differential Analyzer** | Uses dimension roles |
| **Replay Engine** | Restores manifold per step |
| **Export Pipelines** | Includes manifold metadata |
| **Testing Suite** | Validates manifold consistency |

The manifold is the **interpretation contract** for the node.

